    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to King Crab!</strong> Step into a vibrant, ever-changing virtual paradise where creativity, strategy, and adventure collide. In this immersive VR experience, you'll guide a lovable crab \u2014 affectionately known as The King \u2014 as he battles the relentless tides of a stunning tropical island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings fresh surprises: evolving landscapes, shifting weather, and curious new inhabitants. Shape the sandy shores with your VR tools to build towering defenses and intricate fortresses, crafted to withstand the rising forces of the ocean. From gentle breezes to crashing waves, every change tests your creativity and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather seashells, flags, and hidden beach treasures as you explore the island. Discover upgrades and unlock new tools and materials to shape the sand and fortify your defenses. As the tides grow stronger and more unpredictable, you'll need to adapt your strategies to keep The King safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With lifelike physics, dynamic environments, and fully immersive VR gameplay, King Crab transports you to a world where every moment offers new challenges and discoveries. Grab your headset, defend The King, and dive into a VR adventure where survival meets creativity! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Please ensure you have a VR headset compatible with the game's system requirements to fully enjoy the King Crab experience.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to King Crab!</strong> Step into a vibrant, ever-changing virtual paradise where creativity, strategy, and adventure collide. In this immersive VR experience, you'll guide a lovable crab \u2014 affectionately known as The King \u2014 as he battles the relentless tides of a stunning tropical island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings fresh surprises: evolving landscapes, shifting weather, and curious new inhabitants. Shape the sandy shores with your VR tools to build towering defenses and intricate fortresses, crafted to withstand the rising forces of the ocean. From gentle breezes to crashing waves, every change tests your creativity and quick thinking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather seashells, flags, and hidden beach treasures as you explore the island. Discover upgrades and unlock new tools and materials to shape the sand and fortify your defenses. As the tides grow stronger and more unpredictable, you'll need to adapt your strategies to keep The King safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With lifelike physics, dynamic environments, and fully immersive VR gameplay, King Crab transports you to a world where every moment offers new challenges and discoveries. Grab your headset, defend The King, and dive into a VR adventure where survival meets creativity! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: Please ensure you have a VR headset compatible with the game's system requirements to fully enjoy the King Crab experience.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into King Crab, a VR adventure where you build sandcastles to protect a charming crab from relentless tides. Explore an evolving tropical island with changing weather, hidden treasures, and rising challenges. Creativity meets survival on the shore!",
